The preparation request field names and candidate request shape were adapted
from gpt2agent's gpt2agent/sentinel_bridge.py at revision
20669693dd608a94a5b5aba54c4c4a036f064375:
https://github.com/robotlearning123/gpt2agent

The normalized history/citation field contracts were also researched from
gpt2agent/tools/conversations.py and gpt2agent/citations.py at that same revision.
Model catalog and init-limit metadata were researched from
gpt2agent/tools/account.py and gpt2agent/backend.py at that revision.
The bounded Rust normalizers, graph validation, continuation restrictions, and
URL filtering are original implementation work.

